        <span>© 2026 Akshaya Krishnan • Digital Marketing & Brand Portfolio</span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-champagne"></span> Constantly Iterating</span>
      </div>
